      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "PickACard",
        "name": "Pick a Card",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Twisted Fate chooses a magic card from his deck, and uses that for his next attack, causing bonus effects.",
        "bodyHtml": "Twisted Fate begins shuffling his deck, allowing him to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to lock in one of three cards and enhance his next Attack.<br /><span>The Blue Card deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/60/80/100/120 + (100% Attack Damage) + (100% Ability Power) + (2300/3450/4600/5750/6900% Critical Strike Chance)) magic damage</span> and restores <span>70/90/110/130/150 Mana</span>.<span>The Red Card deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/45/60/75/90 + (100% Attack Damage) + (70% Ability Power) + (1050/1575/2100/2625/3150% Critical Strike Chance))</span> to nearby enemies and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 30/35/40/45/50% for 2.5 seconds.<span>The Gold Card deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15/22.5/30/37.5/45 + (100% Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power) + (375/562.5/750/937.5/1125% Critical Strike Chance))</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> for 1/1.25/1.5/1.75/2 seconds.",
